# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Screen Studio (local) configuration
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and edit as needed. `.env` is gitignored so your
# local paths and any secrets stay on your machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Absolute path to ffmpeg/ffprobe. Leave unset to auto-detect from PATH (and, on
# Windows, common winget install locations).
# FFMPEG_PATH=C:\path\to\ffmpeg.exe
# FFPROBE_PATH=C:\path\to\ffprobe.exe

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional local transcription (whisper.cpp). When both are set, exports include
# a transcript and Markdown summary. When unset, those steps are skipped with a
# clear message — nothing is sent anywhere.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHISPER_CPP_BIN=C:\path\to\whisper-cli.exe
# WHISPER_MODEL=C:\path\to\ggml-base.en.bin
